# TraceRail CBM

Read `PROJECT.md` before changing scope. It is the plan.

- Railway condition-based maintenance demo. Success metric is delay minutes avoided.
- Synthetic data only. Never add real OEM drawings, logs, suppliers, or vehicle data.
- One workflow: ingest, score, rank, AI maintenance draft, human accept or edit.
- Call it an operational fleet twin: asset health plus a visible delay-risk formula. Do not add 3D, CAD, physics, Kafka, Kubernetes, SSO, or a neural remaining-life model.
- Stack stays FastAPI, a simple UI, SQLite or Postgres, one JSON LLM call, TF-IDF for similar assets.
- Ship a live URL. If time slips, stub the LLM and deploy the ranked fleet.
- Write code Mert can explain aloud. Small files, straight functions, fleet words. No extra layers, banners, or a comment on every function.
